      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Runtime",
      "items": [
        "One uvicorn process: FastAPI plus 2 asyncio worker loops",
        "SQLite file is the source of truth; the queue is disposable",
        "Startup re-enqueues every pending row — at-least-once, nothing lost on restart"
      ]
